 A single key (or array of keys) that should be parsed as `String`s.
 
+#### options['--']
+Type: `Boolean`<br>
+Default: `false`
+
+When `true`, everything after a bare `--` is placed in `argv['--']` instead of `argv._`. The `argv['--']` array is always present (empty if there was no `--`), and its values are left as-is.
+
+```js
+mri(['a', '--', 'b', '--c'], { '--': true });
+//=> { _:['a'], '--':['b', '--c'] }
+```
+
